<h2 id="what-is-whatsapp-abandoned-cart-recovery-for-shopify"><b>What Is WhatsApp Abandoned Cart Recovery for Shopify?</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">WhatsApp abandoned cart recovery for Shopify is an automated process that sends reminders to shoppers who add products to their cart but leave without completing their purchase. These messages can include product details, personalized offers, and direct checkout links to encourage shoppers to return and place their orders.</span></p>
<p><b>How it works:</b></p>
<ol>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Customer abandons cart:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> A shopper adds products to their cart or starts checkout but doesn&#8217;t complete the order.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Automatic detection: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Shopify app identifies eligible abandoned carts or checkouts.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>WhatsApp reminder:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> After a configured delay, the app sends an automated abandoned cart recovery message via </span><a href="/auth/register"><span style="font-weight: 400;">WhatsApp Business API,</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> including relevant offers and checkout links.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Customer takes action: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">The moment the customer taps the link, they directly reach their cart with items already added by them. </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Send follow-ups:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> If the shopper hasn&#8217;t made the purchase, the system can send another reminder or offer a relevant one.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Stop after purchase:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> After the order is completed, the system stops the subsequent recovery message.</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This allows recovery of potential sales, responds to customer queries about shipping and payments, and minimizes manual follow-ups for Shopify businesses. HelloBotz allows Shopify stores to automate WhatsApp abandoned cart reminders and get customers to convert. </span></p>
